{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35435","headline":"送刘尊师祗诏阙庭三首 一 · 曹唐","name":"送刘尊师祗诏阙庭三首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"海风叶叶驾霓旌，天路悠悠接上清。\n锦诰凄凉遗去恨，玉箫哀绝醉离情。\n五湖夜月幡幢湿，双阙清风劒佩轻。\n从此暂辞华表柱，便应千载是归程。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"曹唐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35435.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35435","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}